        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Retry transient Ollama API failures",
        "body": "## Summary\n- apply the shared transient idempotent retry policy to Ollama API verification\n- retry one 408, 429, 5xx, or transient URL error\n- keep authorization and parse failures non-retryable\n\n## Proof\nThe deterministic transport returns HTTP 503 on attempt one and a valid `/api/tags` payload on attempt two. The fetch succeeds with one model and the counter proves exactly two requests. All 8 focused retry-mapping tests pass.\n\n## Tests\n- `swift test --disable-sandbox --filter OllamaUsageFetcherRetryMappingTests` (8 passed)\n- changed Swift files: SwiftFormat and SwiftLint strict passed\n- `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD`\n\n## Commits\n- 3 focused commits: implementation, tests, documentation",
